**Verdict:** No additional substantive, patch-introduced V1 coverage gap established. I did not count `stagex_native_handoff_uses_only_the_fresh_reserved_provider_path` (`src/source_built_fixed_point_shell.rs:3348-3359`) as behavioral evidence: it checks NCL text. The captured results establish the stated focused tests, including 18 receipt tests in each target, but neither the synthetic fixture nor these noncanonical checks accepts the pending cold proof. No checks were rerun.